  "observations": "Full source and numbered overlay and all 49 small-component crops inspected. Explicit acute tips excluded, retaining small hair/eye details, camel jaw gap, belt-end gap and closed toe spaces. Reconnect the small saddle corner, camel eye-white edge, narrow saddle stripe, person's eye crescent, two separate mouth slits and two belt gap families independently. The camel iris remains separate from its eye white; facial eye white remains separate from the highlight. Human face, neck, torso and arms are continuous through open contour lines; the closed pane beneath the crossed arm remains separate. Pointing hand and forearm pane at left remain distinct. Saddle panels, bridle straps/joint, head and neck panes, robe/legs/feet and pouch beads retain boundaries. Names describe visible features without asserting historical identity or location. Source pixels and earlier geometry remain unchanged.",
